    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_32",
      "hash64": "A021CA35E0439D23",
      "text": "Le maschere rubate dai beniamici sono\\nconservate al Centro Nordivia, sai?[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_14",
      "hash64": "A028DC35E049DA67",
      "text": "Per la gente del paese l’orco della leggenda è\\nun mostro spaventoso, ma... a me sta simpatico.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_15",
      "hash64": "A028DB35E049D8B4",
      "text": "È davvero una forza, e non fa una piega neanche\\nquando viene escluso e maltrattato dagli umani...\\r\\nÈ il mio mito da quando ero piccolo.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 137,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_33",
      "hash64": "A021C935E0439B70",
      "text": "Anche io voglio diventare tosto come lui.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_34",
      "hash64": "A021D035E043A755",
      "text": "C’è sempre mia sorella a occuparsi di me quando\\nho un problema... anche a scuola...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_35",
      "hash64": "A021CF35E043A5A2",
      "text": "Ma voglio imparare ad arrangiarmi da solo, ecco.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_36",
      "hash64": "A021CE35E043A3EF",
      "text": "Che bello sarebbe diventare indipendente e...\\nfare amicizia con il signor orco![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_16",
      "hash64": "A028DE35E049DDCD",
      "text": "Ops! Cioè... Ehm... Ah! Mi sono appena ricordato\\nche dobbiamo fare una foto! Dai, all’opera![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_17",
      "hash64": "A028DD35E049DC1A",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Anche questa volta lascio fare a te,\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_18",
      "hash64": "A028D035E049C603",
      "text": "Quando ci sei tu non devo preoccuparmi\\nproprio di nulla, eh?[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_37",
      "hash64": "A021CD35E043A23C",
      "text": "Allora, il prossimo cartello...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_38",
      "hash64": "A021D435E043AE21",
      "text": "Ora che ci penso, andando da quella parte\\nsi sale sul monte dove vive l’orco.\\r\\nSi chiama Monte Orco proprio per quello.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_39",
      "hash64": "A021D335E043AC6E",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)], ti va di andare a vedere la sua\\ntana? Tutti la chiamano [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Antro del Terrore[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
